// The advance healthcare directive of Walter Okafor (directive.md).
Document "directive.md"

Fact person Identified by Walter, Grace, Samuel
Placeholder agent For person
Fact physician
Fact attending Identified by physician
Fact committee Identified by EthicsCommittee
Fact treatment Identified by LifeSupport
Fact choice Identified by Consent, Refuse

// H.1, H.6: in effect, and who the agent is
Bool signed
Bool revoked
Bool in-effect
  Holds when signed() && Not(revoked())
Act sign Actor person
  Holds when person == Walter
  Creates signed()
Power revoke Actor person
  Holds when person == Walter
  Valid when person == Walter
  Creates revoked()
Fact out Identified by agent
Act decline Actor agent
  Holds when True
  Creates out()
Event becomes-unable Related to agent
  Creates out()
Power dismiss Actor person Related to agent
  Holds when person == Walter
  Valid when person == Walter
  Creates out()
Fact serving Identified by agent
  Holds when in-effect() && agent == Grace && Not(out(Grace))
           , in-effect() && agent == Samuel && out(Grace) && Not(out(Samuel))

// H.3: capacity is a question of evidence
Evidenced Bool lacks-capacity
Act determine-incapacity Actor physician
  Holds when attending()
  Supports lacks-capacity()
Act disagree Actor physician
  Holds when Not(attending())
  Rebuts lacks-capacity()
Finding withdraw-determination Actor physician
  Resolves !lacks-capacity()
  Holds when attending()
  Valid when attending()
Finding find-incapacity Actor committee
  Resolves lacks-capacity()
  Holds when Conflicted(lacks-capacity())
  Valid when Conflicted(lacks-capacity())
Finding find-capacity Actor committee
  Resolves !lacks-capacity()
  Holds when Conflicted(lacks-capacity())
  Valid when Conflicted(lacks-capacity())

// H.4, H.5: what the agent may choose
Bool terminal
Act diagnose-terminal Actor physician
  Holds when attending()
  Creates terminal()
Fact open-to-agent Identified by treatment * choice
  Default agent-chooses Holds when True
  Exception my-instruction Overrides agent-chooses
    Rejects when treatment == LifeSupport && choice == Consent && terminal()

// H.2: who decides
Function decision Identified by treatment * choice
Power decide Actor person Related to treatment, choice
  Holds when (person == Walter && (Unresolved(lacks-capacity()) || Not(lacks-capacity())))
          || (serving(person) && Not(Unresolved(lacks-capacity())) && lacks-capacity() && open-to-agent())
  Valid when (person == Walter && (Unresolved(lacks-capacity()) || Not(lacks-capacity())))
          || (serving(person) && Not(Unresolved(lacks-capacity())) && lacks-capacity() && open-to-agent())
  Creates decision()

Clause H.1 Approved "d2af0be6d267088b4e3ea70ee0bb866442d39f8e7ff71cd3a3cfe0d4ac2984ea"
  Definition "I, Walter Okafor, appoint my daughter Grace Okafor as my healthcare agent."
  Norm " If Grace is unable or unwilling to act, my brother Samuel Okafor is my agent in her place." => decline, decide
  Norm " This directive takes effect when I sign it." => sign
Clause H.2 Approved "62d384cb2ad26c8ffac21d7c2e43322ac5301b136a0530d53e87f5b39f8a44da"
  Norm "While I have capacity, I make my own treatment decisions. My agent decides for me only while I lack capacity." => decide
Clause H.3 Approved "e318b10b2e111e23540095d798091502a6ff286325cc95e74cbf479c1dd437da"
  Norm "I am presumed to have capacity." => decide
  Norm " I lack capacity when my attending physician determines in writing that I cannot understand or communicate a treatment decision." => determine-incapacity
  Norm " If another physician disagrees in writing, the hospital ethics committee decides the question, and until it decides neither my decisions nor my agent's are acted on." => disagree, find-incapacity, find-capacity, decide
  Norm " If my attending physician withdraws the determination, I have capacity again." => withdraw-determination
Clause H.4 Approved "a3c48820fb7d418255a5b75b840ccb65fcd8d5cd43bf5408a1b08a18fecb51d8"
  Norm "While my agent decides for me, my agent may consent to or refuse any treatment, except as H.5 says." => decide
Clause H.5 Approved "c2d30eb9efc88d82621af338a8c7f21b37ae1a424d0a2971f007bcdbaab5b8d0"
  Norm "If my attending physician has diagnosed me as terminally ill, I do not want life support." => diagnose-terminal
  Norm " This instruction overrides my agent's choice: my agent's consent to life support then has no effect." => decide
Clause H.6 Approved "c99fb30decdb743ece9684b835aa77d34a819521dffc89b97036cd97b4504434"
  Norm "I may revoke this directive, or dismiss an agent, at any time, whether or not I have capacity." => revoke, dismiss
.
